# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in a real value.
#
# SEC's fair-access policy requires every automated request to declare a
# contact in the User-Agent header, so EDGAR fetches fail loudly without this
# rather than being sent anonymously. Use an address you actually monitor: if
# SEC needs to reach you about automated access, an unread mailbox turns a
# warning into a block you cannot explain.
#
# Prefer a dedicated address over a personal one. The value is sent on every
# request and stored in a third party's logs indefinitely, and a personal
# address is usually also the account-recovery address for everything else.
EDGAR_CONTACT=you@example.com
